msgid "Nexora widget areas"
msgstr "نواحی ابزارک نکسورا"

#: inc/admin/help-boxes.php:25
msgid "Shop sidebar shows next to the product grid (filters are built in — add extra widgets only if needed). Blog sidebar and Page sidebar appear on posts/pages with a sidebar layout. Footer extra sits above the copyright row."
